      "id": "be-s9-forecasting-methods-c1",
      "heading": "Qualitative or quantitative",
      "explanation_md": "There are two families of forecasting models:\n\n- **Qualitative methods**: forecasts generated **subjectively** by the forecaster.\n- **Quantitative (statistical) methods**: forecasts generated through **mathematical modeling**.",
      "example_ids": [],
      "key_terms": [],
      "exam_line": "Qualitative: subjective judgement. Quantitative: mathematical models.",
      "clarification": null,
